<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 auto;max-width:560px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">
  <tbody>
    <tr><td style="height:4px;background:#4b5563"></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:28px">
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
             <td style="width:32px;height:32px;background:#4b5563;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;vertical-align:middle">S</td>
             <td style="padding-left:12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a">StockFlow Demo</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a">Pesanan dibatalkan</h1>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151">
        Halo <strong><%= @customer.name %></strong>, mohon maaf, pesanan <strong><%= @order.number %></strong> telah dibatalkan.
      </p>
      <div style="background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;color:#991b1b;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 16px">
        Alasan: <strong><%= @reason %></strong>. Stok yang sempat direservasi telah dilepas kembali ke gudang.
      </div>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151">
        Barang masih Anda butuhkan? Anda dapat membuat pesanan baru kapan saja selama stok tersedia.
      </p>
      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:8px 0 4px">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#4b5563;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-align:center">
              <a href="<%= @catalog_url %>" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:14px">Buat Pesanan Baru</a>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p style="margin:18px 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">
   Email ini dikirim otomatis oleh sistem StockFlow Demo. Mohon tidak membalas.
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">
   rachmatm.github.io &middot; maulana.rachmat@gmail.com
</p>
